OL,3,GNEWSACouncil asks for refund over axed
OL,4,Abypass scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has called for a refund after
OL,7,Fplans for a #303m town bypass were axed
OL,8,Fby the government.
OL,10,FThe A350 Melksham Bypass project had
OL,11,Fbeen proposed as a solution to the
OL,12,Fissue of heavy traffic through
OL,13,FWiltshire areas like Melksham and
OL,14,FBeanacre.
OL,16,FIt was dropped after a government
OL,17,Freview. During an emergency debate,
OL,18,FWiltshire councillors backed a motion
OL,19,Fto condemn the decision and they also
OL,20,Fcalled for the #500,000 already spent
OL,21,Fby the council on developing the scheme
OL,22,Fto be refunded.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
