OL,3,GNEWSACouncil asks for refund over axed
OL,4,Abypass scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Department for Transport spokesperson
OL,7,Fsaid a "challenging financial picture"
OL,8,Fhad led to "difficult decisions" on the
OL,9,Ffuture of several road projects, such
OL,10,Fas the Melksham bypass.
